  <h1>About Hashtag SA Unite</h1>

  <h2>Brand Story</h2>
  <p>Hashtag SA Unite was founded to bring people together and spark positive action.
    It began with a vision to create a connected community where voice, purpose,
    and shared goals drive real impact across South Africa.</p>

  <h2>Mission and Values</h2>
  <p>Our mission is to unite individuals and communities through shared purpose,
    collaboration, and empowerment. We value integrity, inclusivity, unity, and driving meaningful change.</p>

  <h2>Target Audience</h2>
  <p>Our work is for passionate individuals, community leaders, organizations, and businesses who care about collaboration,
    progress, and making a lasting positive impact in South Africa.</p>
